&lt;p&gt;A fullscreen page can contain any valid Markdown or HTML content. The theme ensures the content is properly centered and readable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fullscreen pages are accessible via direct links or from slides with &lt;code&gt;target&lt;/code&gt; parameters.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content:encoded><category>Authoring</category></item></channel></rss>